{% comment %}
The shared state every decider question is asked against: the goal, its steps, and the module
catalogue. Handed over ONCE per goal — the questions that follow reference it by path
(`steps[3].text`, `modules.file`) rather than repeating it.

Values render through `store`, so each one writes its own wire form and nothing here hand-rolls
JSON escaping.
{% endcomment %}
{
  "goal": {{ goal.Name | store }},
  "steps": [
    {%- assign sep = "" -%}
    {%- for s in goal.Step -%}
    {{ sep }}{"index": {{ s.Index }}, "text": {{ s.Text | store }}}
    {%- assign sep = "," -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  ],
  "modules": {
    {%- assign sep = "" -%}
    {%- for m in modules -%}
    {{ sep }}{{ m.Name | store }}: {{ m.Description | store }}
    {%- assign sep = "," -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  }
}
